cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalogue or software, please cite the associated manuscript and archived Zenodo release."
title: "A Probabilistic Gaia DR3 Catalogue of Stars with Very Low Galactic Rest-Frame Speeds"
type: dataset
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20116134"
authors:
  - family-names: Humble
    given-names: Rodney
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2623-9232"
    email: "rod.humble@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wodvik/gaia-slow-vgrf-catalogue"
version: "1.2.0-review"
date-released: "2026-07-27"
abstract: "Review-stage software, manuscript, and derived data products for a probabilistic Gaia DR3 catalogue of stars selected by very low Galactic rest-frame speed. Threshold-membership probabilities are corrected for the population prior (Eddington bias) by latent-distribution reconstruction; tiers A / A+B / A+B+C contain 173 / 276 / 621 stars. The uncorrected forward Monte Carlo scores and their tier labels are also released."
keywords:
  - "Gaia DR3"
  - "Galactic kinematics"
  - "stellar catalogue"
  - "Galactic rest-frame velocity"
  - "Eddington bias"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
